hyperactive-interaction-in-the-words-of-the-human-superorganism-5 = unlines (cons "*Interaction* has a twin that nobody pairs with it: *intelligence*. *Intelligere* is *inter* + *legere*, to gather between, to read between, to choose between. *Legere* is the root of *lecture* and *collect* and *elect*, and its Greek cousin *legein* gives *logos* and *logic*. So interaction is driving between and intelligence is gathering between. Superintelligence is gathering between, beyond measure; hyperinteractivity is driving between, beyond measure. The two words joined in the name of the work are one structure seen from two sides: the act and the reading of the act." nil)
